		summary = "The **London School of Economics and Political Science**, commonly known as the **London School of Economics** (**LSE**), is a [[Public university|public]] [[Research university|research university]] in [[London]], England, and a member institution of the University of London. The school specialises in pure and applied [[Social science|social sciences]].",
